WEBVTT

00:00:00.403 --> 00:00:02.522
Quick Win starts with the machine.

00:00:02.522 --> 00:00:06.697
Reels is for slots whose reels spin and stop, with one win a round.

00:00:07.051 --> 00:00:09.611
Set how many reels and rows the board has.

00:00:09.967 --> 00:00:12.662
The timeline under the picture holds the rounds.

00:00:12.662 --> 00:00:14.234
Click a round to work on it.

00:00:14.588 --> 00:00:16.486
Pick the symbol that wins this round.

00:00:16.841 --> 00:00:17.703
Then its cells.

00:00:17.703 --> 00:00:20.745
Pick a preset, or click cells here or on the picture.

00:00:21.098 --> 00:00:21.899
Type the win.

00:00:21.899 --> 00:00:23.871
It splits evenly over the cells.

00:00:24.227 --> 00:00:28.365
Tease a reel to make it stop last, slowing down and crawling into place.

00:00:28.719 --> 00:00:31.876
The spin style and the landing are the same for every round.

00:00:32.229 --> 00:00:34.619
The stop order sets which reel stops first.

00:00:34.971 --> 00:00:40.283
On screen picks what is drawn round a win: a line, framed cells, and the halo effect.

00:00:40.639 --> 00:00:44.052
Win timing plays the winners all together, or one by one.

00:00:46.906 --> 00:00:51.642
Play runs every round in a row, each one starting on the board the last one landed.

00:00:56.009 --> 00:01:00.361
Drag the white marks on a round to move when its reels stop and its win starts.

00:01:00.731 --> 00:01:03.376
Plus Round adds a round after the picked one.
